    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i ate something i'm allergic to at dinner. i have these itchy red hives all over my stomach and chest and my throat feels kind of tight like i've got a lump in it but it's probably just anxiety right?? should i just take some benadryl and go to sleep or is this bad?",
