      "content": "okay fine i won't do that. but seriously, if i just take a normal dose (like 1 or 2) it should kick in pretty fast, right? i can just lie down and if it gets any worse i'll call someone. it's probably just a mild allergy and it'll pass once the antihistamine hits my system. it's just a little throat tightness, i'm not like wheezing or anything yet.",
